/* 

  Min, median, and max of Poisson distributions in Picat.

  Comparing with the order statistics (in go2/0).

  Cf my Gamble model gamble_poisson_min_max.rkt

  This program was created by Hakan Kjellerstrand, hakank@gmail.com
  See also my Picat page: http://www.hakank.org/picat/

*/

import ppl_distributions, ppl_utils.
import util.
% import ordset.

main => go.

